                <invention-title lang="de">HEBE- UND SENKBEHÄLTER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">LEVAGE ET ABAISSEMENT DE CONTENANTS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">RAISING AND LOWERING CONTAINERS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A load-handling device for lifting and moving containers is provided. The load-handling device comprises a body having an upper portion configured to house one or more operation components, and a lower portion comprising a container-receiving space. The load handling device comprises a container-gripping assembly configured to releasably grip a container and a raising and lowering assembly configured to raise and lower the container-gripping assembly. The raising and lowering assembly comprises a single motor configured to raise and lower the container-gripping assembly, and a rotatable shaft. The single motor is mounted outboard of the shaft.A storage and retrieval system is provided, comprising a storage structure and a plurality of load handling devices.</p>
            </abstract>
